.TH CODEX-UBUNTU 1 "May 2026" "codex-ubuntu 0.2.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
codex-ubuntu \- browser fallback preview launcher for Ubuntu desktop integration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B codex-ubuntu
[\fB--browser\fR] [\fB--status\fR] [\fB--doctor\fR] [\fB--stop\fR] [\fB--version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B codex-ubuntu
starts the browser fallback preview launcher for Ubuntu desktop integration.
It is the recovery path while the Electron desktop package is still being
productized.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --browser
Open in a normal browser tab instead of an app-style window.
.TP
.B --status
Show current launcher and runtime status.
.TP
.B --doctor
Show runtime and browser discovery details.
.TP
.B --stop
Stop the verified local web runtime.
.TP
.B --version
Show the launcher version.
